            "review_title": "Review at CƠM GÀ TAM KỲ 135",
            "review_text": "Peter-Chua\nSingapore, Singapore1935 contributions\n0\nChicken noodles\nJan 2026 • Friends\nFor an authentic taste of Central Vietnam in HCMC, Cơm Gà Tam Kỳ 135 is the definitive spot. Occupying two shop houses, this no‑frills eatery is all about chicken—served as rice, noodles, or salad. The star is their Tam Kỳ chicken rice: tender poached chicken with fragrant turmeric rice, perfectly paired with their signature homemade mắm nêm sauce and pickled vegetables. The place is clean, busy, and focused, with a consistent, genuine local vibe. Be prepared for crowds at peak times, and note only carbonated drinks are available. A must‑try for this regional specialty.\nRead more\nWritten January 12, 2026",
