            "review_title": "Review at CƠM GÀ TAM KỲ 135",
            "review_text": "Allie Gone Away\nWashington DC, District of Columbia467 contributions\n0\nHomemade food served with love\nSep 2024 • Couples\nI don’t think I’ve ever felt more warmly welcomed in a restaurant. The owner is the kindest restaurateur alive. Both foreigners & locals are served here with the same kindness & passion. \n\nThe specialty here is the chicken and rice. It is simple & rich & delicious. Other meals include pho and savory porridge. \n\nMeals run about 45K (some up to 80K) and include free ice tea, free soup, and free guava for dessert. \n\nI’d come back here every week if I lived here.\nRead more\nWritten September 10, 2024",
